Write a function sum_dists that takes two unsigned 32-bit numbers n and c and returns the sum, over every i from 0 to n - 1, of the distance between i and c (the larger minus the smaller). The result is 0 when n is 0. Inputs always have n <= 100000. Write and use a helper function dist(a, b) that returns the distance between a and b. Unsigned 32-bit arithmetic wraps around modulo 2^32 (it never traps).
